# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A calm bedroom-wall piece: a long-exposure sky wheeling round its pole, the
# odd meteor ADDED across it, a crescent moon, and a mountain range in front
# of everything — sprites occlude whatever is beneath their opaque texels.
# Designed at 32x32 (`U`): the 64-wide range-and-lake picture is FITTED to
# the full design width, so the moon's reflection sits under the moon on
# every panel (1:1 on 64x64, where the art was drawn).
S - Nocturne
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Star trails
I @pat/starfield-2d
C sliderMode 131072
L pat 0 0 0 0 add 100 none fill 1
N Meteors
I @pat/meteor-shower
C sliderCount 65536
C sliderGapSeconds 262144
C sliderPalette 65536
L sprite 9 1 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Moon
I @spr/moon
L sprite 0 10 32 22 normal 100 none fill 1
N Mountains
I @spr/mountains
